Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:02.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:15.45,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every wave of monsters I defeat \Nis followed by yet another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:21.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aunt Hilde is running around the \Nkingdom putting up barriers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:23.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}but at this rate,\N pillars of light won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:32.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prince Julius refuses to acknowledge\N the danger, no matter how I push.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.80,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He even refused the aid \Nof the Parnacortan knights
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}that my sister tried to send.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.49,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel its presence viscerally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:48.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is close \Nenough for that, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:56.11,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've no time left to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:59.87,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unless I depose Prince Julius, \Nthis kingdom has no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.15,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:04.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the saint of this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will... won't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:10.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Sister Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:34.88,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(710,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&HDA8FA9&}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside\Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.88,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(960,1)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:46.56,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(520,283.044)}Episode 9\N"{\c&H5E8CF0&\fs12}Crossroads {\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&}of Fate"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.56,Main - Top,Erza,0,0,0,,That's a pretty crazy \Nidea you came up with...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.26,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Using a magic-convergence spell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.77,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,to expand the Great Purification Circle \Nto encompass the surrounding kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:56.57,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,A brilliant plan, Miss Greatest. \NOr so I'd like to say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:58.57,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Will it be in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.20,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I believe so, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:05.56,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Well, it will certainty \Nturn things around if it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.06,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,But what if you fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.75,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Big Sis, don't be so pessimi—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.50,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,You stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:18.51,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,In all honesty, how many days \Ndo you think Girtonia has left?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:21.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Around four, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.68,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.43,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Reichardt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:28.73,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to make introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:29.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,These are—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.90,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Erza Notice, exorcist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.99,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,And this is my familiar, Mammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:34.77,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Heyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:39.82,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I believe the church should have \Ninformed you of our arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.24,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Indeed, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:45.92,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Philia, we received word \Nfrom the knights we deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:51.53,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they were turned \Naway at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:56.46,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,They were even falsely accused \Nof exploiting the situation to invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:00.06,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Our knights are a cornerstone\N of our defense, on par with a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:03.25,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,If Girtonia really only has four days...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:05.55,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I may have to order them to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:09.08,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.39,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:13.08,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If a path to the Demon Realm\N forms in Girtonia,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:16.74,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,the awakening of Archdemon Asmodeus\N will soon follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.23,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Even with the circle protecting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:23.26,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,not even Parnacorta may remain unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:24.24,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:28.34,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,You, Saint Philia, are the one he's after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:37.34,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,So, Miss Greatest, are you \Naware of the cycle of rebirth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.29,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:42.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,The Church of Cremoux teaches that \Neven when we die and our bodies decay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:48.30,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,our souls remain, reborn anew\Non and on for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:51.96,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,And where do you think the soul of Fiana,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.67,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,the saint who sealed Asmodeus away, ended up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:57.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Fiana's soul...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:04:58.94,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:00.15,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:07.34,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,The soul of Archsaint Fiana resides in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:13.09,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Which is why we're seeing presages of his \Nreturn as the Demon Realm grows closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:16.04,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.32,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:22.80,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Don't ask me how, but he fell for the\N archsaint over the course of their battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:26.26,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Getting a beating from a gorgeous babe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:30.38,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Must've awakened something in old \NAsmodeus, if you catch my drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:33.50,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,A carnal demon truly falling\Nin love with a saint...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.31,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Romantic, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:37.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.23,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,That's all you have to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:41.90,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Either way, he's after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:47.75,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,For another chance at the love \Nhe was denied four hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.34,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.51,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,How about some tea, Miss Saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.83,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It's important to take breaks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:05.55,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:08.88,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I tried to give you a heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:10.85,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No, that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,My apologies, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.02,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Hey, no problem here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:18.31,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Well... I guess that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:21.01,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,My brother told me about the knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:25.85,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,That, plus the situation in Girtonia \Nand Archdemon Asmodeus...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.36,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,We've got nothing {\i1}but{\i0} problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:31.50,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Still, if I could ask you for just one\N thing... Don't bear this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.26,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia, you've got me—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.75,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I-I mean, everyone in Parnacorta to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.12,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,We're all here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.56,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:41.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure why,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:50.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Prince Osvalt's words calm me \Nas much as the aroma of this tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.65,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Saint Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:55.70,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Once this is all over...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:58.99,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Could we go out together again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.35,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,For a meal, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.73,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,{\i1}An invitation to dinner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.36,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could this be... Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:09.13,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I would be most pleased \Nto accompany you for a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.20,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.42,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.08,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,One more thing to look forward to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:20.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is it that when I see him smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.08,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.70,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:31.76,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's really holding a party\N at a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:33.76,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Against unprecedented crisis,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:37.26,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}this was meant to rally us, \Nbanding us together in our struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:39.77,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there's no sign of that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all acting like nothing's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:46.52,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}even with the Demon Realm's \Napproach peaking at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:52.28,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, that's all the more reason \Nto give them a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.52,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll show them the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:58.84,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}and muster all the kingdom's resources \Nfor the incoming demon horde!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:00.66,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The question is, will it be in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.83,Flashback - Italics,Himari,0,0,0,,Would you like to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:04.83,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because this is my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.93,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Hey there, Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:15.76,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You look even more beautiful than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:19.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You'll stick with me tonight, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:22.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:23.19,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,We're engaged, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.79,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,You seem to be in high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:30.28,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Are you enjoying this "party" \Nof yours that much, Julius?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.00,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If it isn't my dear elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:36.13,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you feeling so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.99,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Parties are a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.12,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Especially this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:43.87,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,A party with the mission\N of bringing us all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.88,Default,Noble 1,0,0,0,,It's Prince Fernand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.88,Default,Noble 1,0,0,0,,So the rumors of his return are true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:52.22,Default,Noble 2,0,0,0,,You think his health will hold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.31,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I am Crown Prince Fernand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.97,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have worried you all for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:03.63,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,With my father taken ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:06.73,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'm sure we all feel the threat \Nto our kingdom ever more keenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.15,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,But worry not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:14.48,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I swear to do everything in my power \Nto help us ride out this crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.61,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Join me, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.90,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'm glad I made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.63,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You were amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:31.88,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:37.80,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,That was a brilliant speech, dear brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:39.68,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.27,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:47.14,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'm going to take my medicine. \NIf you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:49.76,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'll be back for the toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.44,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I know, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:57.99,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Let's pick a date for our wedding reception \Nand announce it to everyone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,My, what a wonderful idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:06.93,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Still, there's no telling how \Nlong this emergency will last...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:10.60,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It might be wise to wait until \Nthe worst has passed, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.18,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You worry too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:16.88,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,But fret not! We'll have good news very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:21.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Everything that's about to happen \Nis for our future together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:25.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Now, let the party begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.70,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Come, Brother. Let's have a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:36.23,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Surely one glass won't set \Nyour recovery back, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:43.45,Default,George,0,0,0,,Now, as we all pledge our \Nloyalty to the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:48.00,Default,George,0,0,0,,and the eternal prosperity \Nof the Kingdom of Girtonia...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.57,Default,George,0,0,0,,A toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.59,Default,All,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:10.31,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Julius, what did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:15.82,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Farewell, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.99,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.18,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Fernand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.66,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Call a doctor! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:32.15,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,He's... not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.67,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,No pulse, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:39.83,Default,Noblewoman,0,0,0,,No... Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:44.12,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,No, we can... We can still save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.97,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'll put my heart and soul \Ninto a resurrection spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:51.23,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,If I act before his soul leaves \Nhis body, I can save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:55.08,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia, wait for the doctor. \NDon't do anything foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.11,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.28,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,But if I can do this—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.25,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Really, there's need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:04.03,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.87,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Because I don't want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.75,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you're saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:15.21,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's effectively admitting that he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Julius... we should \Nhear from the king about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.41,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Yes, we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:24.40,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Assuming he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.37,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You know the state he's been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.47,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:32.90,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,The castle guard is light tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.87,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,with so many of their number diverted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:40.03,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If someone were to try something,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:43.11,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,we should be receiving word just about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:44.78,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.62,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:50.35,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,His Majesty... is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.71,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:04.88,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Now I'm the king! No one can refuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.28,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,They were in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:10.06,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,My father who denied me the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.64,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,My brother who refused \Nto abdicate despite his illness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:15.97,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I was so sick of both of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.66,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Let this be an example as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:21.56,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,This is what happens \Nwhen you stand in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:24.32,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Oh, I feel so liberated!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.16,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:33.46,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why would you go to such \Nlengths for the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:36.16,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Why? That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:40.78,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,As everyone knows, \Nthe world exists to serve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:43.13,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,And Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:46.93,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,As my beloved, I gift you the queenship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.72,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Aren't you overjoyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:52.68,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,My Mia, let's get married this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:53.43,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.56,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:14:01.11,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.58,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.80,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.82,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,It wasn't a resurrection spell,\N I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.58,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:17.55,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I knew you were planning this all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:23.94,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,The night of the party, he's going \Nto try to kill both Fernand and the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.22,Flashback,Mia,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:30.59,Flashback,Pyrz's Son,0,0,0,,To protect our kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:38.85,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't the only one afraid for the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:41.99,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Knowing this was coming,\N I was able to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:46.36,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I took the antidote when \NI stepped away briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:48.61,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,This is stage blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:52.73,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I pretended to drink the wine,\N then burst the packet I had ready
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:54.16,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,and fell over dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.45,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,A compelling performance, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:01.02,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,As you can see, I am completely unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:05.00,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,B-Brother, you do love to joke around...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.34,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Our father's alive as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:08.47,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.37,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Those assassins you sent...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:13.72,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,should be getting a taste \Nof their own medicine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.34,Default,Nobleman 1,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:22.24,Main - Top,Nobleman 2,0,0,0,,There's no justifying this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.76,Default,Noblewoman,0,0,0,,It's high treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:25.23,Main - Top,Nobleman 3,0,0,0,,Even as a prince, \Nit will be his head for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.53,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've earned a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:30.50,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,And you tied the noose for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:32.24,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,when you tried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:34.32,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:37.44,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,An incompetent shut-in like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:39.91,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'm superior to you in every way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:43.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,The kingdom's better off \Nwith me on the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:46.42,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,What's wrong with getting rid \Nof who would stop me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:49.05,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,What's wrong with killing you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:52.43,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Everyone would rather have me\N on the throne than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:53.94,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:57.51,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Look at them now and say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:03.17,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Are you idiots going to turn on me, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:08.33,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now it begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:12.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indiscriminate punishment for all \Nthose who betrayed my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.70,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:17.33,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You joined him because he pressed you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:20.17,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Please, you're my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:21.78,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You have to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:23.71,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If the saint vouches for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:24.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You have it backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.34,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take him to the heights of ecstasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.25,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}give him a long leash,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.25,0:16:35.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then, when I deem the time to be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:37.03,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:41.85,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It wasn't Prince Fernand \Nwho came up with this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.23,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll betray him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:51.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}To take down a member of the royal family,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:54.28,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,there needs to be a crime \Nand unambiguous proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:59.74,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I needed to stage a performance \Nwith all here as witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:05.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}In addition, I needed everyone—supporters\Nof both princes, as well as the neutrals—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:10.75,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}to come together across political lines \Nand understand the danger we're facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:14.99,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Plotting to kill His Majesty \Nand the crown prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:18.72,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Julius, you are guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.76,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,This is an indisputable fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:24.63,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,M-Mia? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:25.99,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're my wife—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:29.11,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Second Prince Julius Girtonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:33.03,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,As you are a criminal, \Nunder the laws of our kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:36.53,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,our engagement is officially terminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:38.98,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,T-Terminated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.80,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Y-You're turning on me, your dearest love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your gullibility knows \Nno bounds, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:49.04,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Me, love the man who\N sold away my precious sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:53.42,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Kindly refrain from saying \Nsuch revolting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.33,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.35,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:18:00.18,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Marry me and I'll make you so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:05.63,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You know nothing about \Nwhat would make me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:11.11,Default,George,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.30,Default,George,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:16.03,Default,George,0,0,0,,Doing this to us... to His Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.41,Default,George,0,0,0,,Why do something so idiotic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:20.56,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.79,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:27.54,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You treated Philia like garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.50,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,And you have the nerve to ask me that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:37.51,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You asked so much of her\Nand treated her so coldly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:41.27,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Then, in the end, you threw her out\Nand sold her to another kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:46.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,She worked so hard to earn the love of the \Npeople she believed to be her parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.34,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Yet you so happily trampled all over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I cannot brook that,\Neven if you are my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:57.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,My sister was the perfect saint.\NShe did so much for our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:19:00.56,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,But she was also an ordinary girl, \Nno different than the rest of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.70,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Why can't you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:05.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Give her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.07,0:19:07.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Give her back...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:11.08,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Give back my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:12.95,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.52,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did she say Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.47,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why must you bring her up now, of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:26.47,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ever since I was a child,\N I believed myself to be superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:31.23,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Academics, fencing... I mastered everything\N without the slightest effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.91,Flashback,Noble 1,0,0,0,,Amazing, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:33.92,Flashback - Top,Noble 2,0,0,0,,You have a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:35.48,Flashback,Noble 3,0,0,0,,It's a sign of superior blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:40.31,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I soon learned I wasn't like other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:42.27,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:44.74,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only one who refused to see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:48.56,Flashback,King of Girtonia,0,0,0,,Julius, work on your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.65,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:52.50,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what did that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:57.25,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}My brother, Fernand, was sickly, \Nincompetent, worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:20:00.53,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was the one with the superior \Nblood, the gift, the genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:05.45,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}The perfect prince to whom all should bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.26,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:10.42,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes... until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.19,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.81,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,My name is Philia Adenauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:16.97,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.30,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}That woman was my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:22.21,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}A monster come to shatter \Nmy absolute perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.82,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I sold her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.70,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could again be the perfect prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:31.24,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, the perfect king!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.88,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:36.33,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why must I be hindered, even now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.32,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:41.42,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let that woman beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:44.09,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the one with superior blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:45.92,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.85,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You really had me fooled, Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.10,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:56.63,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You'll be the one thrown into prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:59.49,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,For trying to set me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.49,0:21:03.66,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Julius, don't humiliate \Nyourself any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:07.45,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Everyone present is a witness \Nto your foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.58,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You're the foolish one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.29,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Deceiving the king is a crime, \Ndon't you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.82,0:21:14.11,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:17.66,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Anyone! Take these two into custody!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:20.97,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,We just need to silence her testimony!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:24.30,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If you help me, I'll reward you\N with anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.25,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:27.32,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:30.48,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Some—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:34.93,Default,King of Girtonia,0,0,0,,Haven't you shamed yourself enough, Julius?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:39.27,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You, old man! You'd better \Nnot talk to me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:40.69,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Do you know who I—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:44.19,Default,King of Girtonia,0,0,0,,Do {\i1}you{\i0} know who {\i1}I{\i0} am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.45,Default,King of Girtonia,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten \Nyour own father's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:50.95,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,H-His Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.85,0:23:32.64,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside by \NMy Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:34.97,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Next time, episode 10:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\fs18\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H0F0F10&\4c&H302E2C&\pos(320,67.102)\b1}Next Time
