Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\an8\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H4E4E4E&\fs20\4c&H6A6763&\b1\pos(320,255)}"What I Wish to {\fs24\c&H9CE970&\4c&HFFFFFF&}Protect{\fs20\c&HFBFFFF&\4c&H6A6763&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:37.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,"What I Wish to Protect."
